          "width": 300,
          "height": 120,
          "content": "Logo strategy: Brand-tinted landmark icons are PLACEHOLDERS. Implementation uses real aggregator logo URLs (from the Logo field on each institution). Letter-initial tile is the last-resort fallback when no logo URL exists. The light #F0F0F0 tile background ships as-is for all logo styles."
