        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "eFl3H",
          "x": 470,
          "y": 2888,
          "name": "Flow Note - Fork",
          "width": 400,
          "height": 170,
          "content": "NEW FORK. After a bank is picked in Institution Picker, this Connection Method screen asks Automatic vs Manual.\n\n• Automatic → existing bank-link flow unchanged (Bootstrap Busy → Credentials → Challenges → First Sync).\n• Manual → Select Cards → Card Details → Result.\n\nInstitution Picker itself is visually unchanged; only its on-tap navigation now routes here first instead of straight into the bank-link flow."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "G39wZA",
          "x": 470,
          "y": 3078,
          "name": "Flow Note - Result",
          "width": 400,
          "height": 150,
          "content": "RESULT PATTERN. Reuses the same success/failure mental model as automatic linking: an outcome summary with per-card status. Successful cards list under ADDED; failures list under COULDN'T ADD with a reason + Retry. If all cards succeed the failure section is simply hidden. Card Details are optional here and fully editable later from the Cards page."
        }
      ]
