          "type": "note",
          "id": "hUQhy",
          "x": 30,
          "y": 920,
          "name": "Rename & Identify Entry Points",
          "width": 2280,
          "height": 130,
          "content": "ENTRY POINTS\n- Identify CTA (banner on Cards screen, banner on Card Detail - Unidentified) -> opens Card Product Picker filtered to that card's bank.\n- Pencil icon on any card detail header (universal rename) -> opens the SAME Card Product Picker. Renaming means picking the correct product from the card catalog so rewards/perks attach.\n- Manual Rename sheet is ONLY reachable from the picker's 'My card isn't listed - rename manually' fallback link, which appears when the issuer has no catalog match. Freeform text with the 'rewards won't be available' warning is correct only in that scope - the pencil icon never opens Manual Rename directly."
        }
      ]
